---@field StreamName? aws.cognito_sync.StreamName The name of the Cognito stream to receive updates. This stream must be in the developers account and in the same region as the identity pool.
---@field RoleArn? aws.cognito_sync.AssumeRoleArn The ARN of the role Amazon Cognito can assume in order to publish to the stream. This role must grant access to Amazon Cognito (cognito-sync) to invoke PutRecord on your Cognito stream.
