---Initiates a bulk publish of all existing datasets for an Identity Pool to the configured stream. Customers are limited to one successful bulk publish per 24 hours. Bulk publish is an asynchronous request, customers can see the status of the request via the GetBulkPublishDetails operation.
---
---`POST /identitypools/{IdentityPoolId}/bulkpublish`
---Errors: AlreadyStreamedException, DuplicateRequestException, InternalErrorException, InvalidParameterException, NotAuthorizedException, ResourceNotFoundException.
---@param input aws.cognito_sync.BulkPublishRequest
---@return aws.cognito_sync.BulkPublishResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:bulk_publish(input) end

---Deletes the specific dataset. The dataset will be deleted permanently, and the action can't be undone. Datasets that this dataset was merged with will no longer report the merge. Any subsequent operation on this dataset will result in a ResourceNotFoundException.
---
---`DELETE /identitypools/{IdentityPoolId}/identities/{IdentityId}/datasets/{DatasetName}`
---Errors: InternalErrorException, InvalidParameterException, NotAuthorizedException, ResourceConflictException, ResourceNotFoundException, TooManyRequestsException.
---@param input aws.cognito_sync.DeleteDatasetRequest
---@return aws.cognito_sync.DeleteDatasetResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:delete_dataset(input) end

---Gets meta data about a dataset by identity and dataset name. With Amazon Cognito Sync, each identity has access only to its own data. Thus, the credentials used to make this API call need to have access to the identity data.
---
---`GET /identitypools/{IdentityPoolId}/identities/{IdentityId}/datasets/{DatasetName}`
---Errors: InternalErrorException, InvalidParameterException, NotAuthorizedException, ResourceNotFoundException, TooManyRequestsException.
---@param input aws.cognito_sync.DescribeDatasetRequest
---@return aws.cognito_sync.DescribeDatasetResponse? value
---@return distilled.Error? err
function Client:describe_dataset(input) end

